#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:5
msgid "Data Disclaimer"
msgstr "Datenhinweis"

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:6
msgid "Please don't enter sensitive data on this page."
msgstr "Bitte trage auf dieser Seite keine sensiblen Daten ein."

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:7
msgid "Think about using nicknames."
msgstr "Denk drüber nach, Nicknamen zu benutzen."

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:8
msgid ""
"I can not and will not make any guarantees about the safety of your data "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Ich kann und will keine Garantien für die Sicherheit deiner Daten hier "
"geben."

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:9
msgid "In fact, I will probably do shenanigans with it."
msgstr "Tatsächlich werde ich vermutlich Blödsinn damit anstellen."

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:10
msgid "Shenanigans may include, but are not limited to:"
msgstr "Zum Blödsinn kann unter anderem gehören:"

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:12
msgid "Read your data"
msgstr "deine Daten ansehen"

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:13
msgid "Eat your data"
msgstr "deine Daten anbeißen"

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:14
msgid "Put you on santas naughty list"
msgstr "dich beim Weihnachtsmann verpetzen"

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:15
msgid "Trash it"
msgstr "trash it"

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:16
msgid "Change it"
msgstr "change it"

#: templates/data-disclaimer.html:17
msgid "Mail-upgrade it"
msgstr "mail-upgrade it"

#: templates/exchange-overview.html:6
msgid ""
"Here are the results! Click your name to see who you're getting a gift "
"for."
msgstr ""
"Hier sind die Ergebnisse der Auslosung! Klicke auf deinen Namen, um zu "
"erfahren, wen du beschenken darfst."

#: templates/exchange-overview.html:13
msgid "Next Exchange"
msgstr "Nächste Auslosung"

#: templates/exchange-overview.html:14
msgid ""
"Ready for the next round? Create a new exchange here while carrying over "
"the constraints and results."
msgstr ""
"Bereit für die nächste Runde? Lege hier eine neue Auslosung an und übertrage "
"dabei Einschränkungen und Ergebnisse."

#: templates/exchange-overview.html:16
msgid "Name of new exchange:"
msgstr "Name der neuen Auslosung:"

#: templates/exchange-overview.html:18
msgid "Copy exchange"
msgstr "Auslosung kopieren"

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:7
msgid "Confirm your name"
msgstr "Namen bestätigen"

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:8
#, python-format
msgid "Are you %(name)s and want to see who you'll be getting a gift for?"
msgstr "Bist du %(name)s und möchtest wissen, wen du beschenken wirst?"

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:10
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ja"

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:11
msgid "No"
msgstr "Nein"

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:15
#, python-format
msgid "Hello %(name)s!"
msgstr "Hallo %(name)s!"

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:16
#, python-format
msgid "You're getting a gift for %(giftee)s."
msgstr "Du beschenkst %(giftee)s."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:19
msgid "I can't stand surprises and want to know who I'm getting a gift from."
msgstr ""
"Ich kann Überraschungen nicht leiden und möchte gerne wissen, von wem ich"
" ein Geschenk bekomme."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:21
msgid "Click to reveal name"
msgstr "Klicken, um Namen anzuzeigen"

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:24
#, python-format
msgid "You're getting a gift from %(giver)s."
msgstr "Du wirst von %(giver)s beschenkt."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:28
msgid "My name is not correct, I need to change it."
msgstr "Mein Name stimmt nicht, ich möchte ihn ändern."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:30
#, python-format
msgid "Your current name is %(participantName)s."
msgstr "Dein aktueller Name ist %(participantName)s."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:31
msgid "If that is not correct, you can change it here."
msgstr "Falls das nicht stimmt, kannst du es hier ändern."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:32
msgid ""
"Your old name will immediately be replaced with your new name everywhere "
"in this exchange."
msgstr "Dein alter Name wird sofort überall in dieser Auslosung ersetzt."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:33
msgid ""
"Please use a name that the other participants of this exchange know you "
"as, if possible."
msgstr ""
"Verwende bitte einen Namen, unter dem dich die anderen Teilnehmer kennen,"
" falls möglich."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:34
msgid ""
"Links containing your old name will continue to work, and will "
"automatically be redirected."
msgstr ""
"Links, die deinen alten Namen enthalten, funktionieren weiterhin und "
"leiten automatisch weiter."

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:37
msgid "Change you name to:"
msgstr "Namen ändern zu:"

#: templates/exchange-user-result.html:39
msgid "Change name"
msgstr "Namen ändern"

#: templates/rename-exchange.html:5
msgid "Oops"
msgstr "Hoppla"

#: templates/rename-exchange.html:6
msgid "It seems like an exchange with this name already exists."
msgstr "Es scheint schon eine Auslosung mit diesem Namen zu geben."

#: templates/rename-exchange.html:7
msgid "Most likely someone created it while you were entering the data for yours."
msgstr ""
"Wahrscheinlich hat sie jemand angelegt, während du dabei warst, die Daten"
" für deine einzutragen."

#: templates/rename-exchange.html:8
msgid "Please choose a new name for your exchange to proceed."
msgstr "Bitte gib deiner Auslosung einen neuen Namen, bevor du weitermachst."

#: templates/rename-exchange.html:11
msgid "Create your gift exchange as:"
msgstr "Deine Auslosung mit folgendem Namen anlegen:"

#: templates/rename-exchange.html:18
msgid "Create exchange"
msgstr "Auslosung anlegen"

#: templates/start.html:10
msgid "Open or create gift exchange:"
msgstr "Auslosung öffnen oder anlegen:"

#: templates/start.html:12
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Öffnen"

